<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1847_6857.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig deinst, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir ehren
<lb n="2"/>liebs und guots <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, From, Fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrsamm</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>Wyß, Innsonders guot fründt und gethrüw lieb <orgName resp="#ner">Eidtgnossen</orgName>.
<lb n="4"/>Wir sind <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear> dato von unsers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrüwen</unclear> mitraths haupt-
<lb n="5"/>man <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Niclauß</unclear> Vogels</persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saeligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wittwen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rechtgebnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vogt</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/>Unnd <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heidlj</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eblj</unclear></persName>, alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">baß</unclear> nechsten Erben, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bluots</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/>verwandten, wylandt üwers Bürgers <persName resp="#ner">Joß Walthis</persName> saelig
<lb n="8"/>bricht worden, Welcher maßen inen uß bedencklichen
<lb n="9"/>ursachen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sollich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbguot</unclear> noch bißhar nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allencklichen</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>folgen moegen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syedann</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> ermelte Erben, har-
<lb n="11"/>umb uff bestimte Jahr gnuogsame Bürgschafft (by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>in daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">künfftig</unclear>, wann es die notturfft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erforderen</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sollich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haab</unclear> unnd guot widerumb zefinden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear>.)
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darstellend</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haruf</unclear> sy nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ermanglet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwen</unclear> ehrliche
<lb n="15"/>herren (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lutß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">l</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear> an unß abgang-
<lb n="16"/>nem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schryben</unclear>.) von unseren Räthen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeerbaeten</unclear>, sich nach
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethanem</unclear> begeren In diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bürgschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwey</unclear> oder
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drü</unclear> Jahr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inzelaßen</unclear>. Und die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyl</unclear> dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> ge-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thrüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mitrath</unclear> Herr <persName resp="#ner">Adam <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Boeninger</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lanndtß</unclear>-
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Statthalter</unclear>, von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgedachter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frauw</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wittib</unclear>, unnd <persName resp="#ner">Hanß
