<lb n="22"/>Erb, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgehoerter</unclear> maßen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bürg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesin</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuogsame</unclear>
