<lb n="26"/>Uff solches so habend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Parthÿen</unclear> an unß wider-
<lb n="27"/>rumb angelanngt, Vorgedachten unsern Lanndtß-
<lb n="28"/>Statthalter uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserm</unclear> mittel, zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">l</unclear>. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abzeordnen</unclear>, dises Erbs halber, waß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>noch gehoeren moechtj, rechenschafft zeempfahen, und
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daßelb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inzenemmen</unclear>, Und ob er sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glychwol</unclear>
